  @doc """
  Computes the running sum of a list of numbers.

  The running sum at index `i` is the sum of all elements from index `0` through `i` in the original list.

  ## Examples

      iex> Solution.runningsum([1, 2, 3, 4])
      [1, 3, 6, 10]

